{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2023-01-04 16:15:00', 'title': 'METCAL RELEASES NEW MSA SERIES SMOKE ABSORBERS', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , JAN. 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- METCAL, PART OF OK INTERNATIONAL\xa0AND DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV), AND A LEADER IN BENCHTOP SOLDERING FOR ELECTRONICS AND INDUSTRIAL MANUFACTURING, ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF ITS NEW MSA SERIES SMOKE ABSORBERS, WHICH ARE SPACE-SAVING COMPACT WORKBENCH FANS THAT USE ACTIVATED CARBON FILTERS TO EXTRACT HARMFUL FLUX FUMES AND SMOKE DURING HAND SOLDERING OPERATIONS.'}